{"unit_id":4,"stage_id":4,"lesson":{"lesson_id":6,"lesson_key":"S4L6","stage_id":4,"title":"Zameer-e-Muttasil Mukhaatab: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Zameer-e-Muttasil Mukhaatab: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","en":"2nd Person Masc. Singular Attached Pronoun (Your): بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","ur":"ضمیرِ متصل مخاطب: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","hi":"ज़मीर-ए-मुत्तसिल मुख़ातब: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ"},"arabic_Focus":"بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","hinglish_Focus":"Ghar → Tera ghar","page_numbers":"16","book_page":16,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","hinglish":"Ghar → Tera ghar","arabic_word":"بَيْتٌ","arabic_combined":"بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","hinglish_word":"Ghar","hinglish_combined":"Ghar → Tera ghar","title_en":"Zameer-e-Muttasil Mukhaatab: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ","subtitle":"Unit 4 • Lesson 6 (Book Page 16)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"بَيْتٌ","after_ar":"بَيْتُكَ","before_hi":"Ghar","after_hi":"Tera ghar"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S4L6 — Zameer-e-Muttasil Mukhaatab: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S4L6 — Zameer-e-Muttasil Mukhaatab: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["بَيْتٌ (Ghar)","بَيْتُكَ","Tera ghar"],["رَبٌّ (Rabb)","رَبُّكَ","Tera (Aapka) Rabb"],["رَحْمَةٌ / وَعْدُ","رَحْمَتُكَ / وَعْدُكَ","Teri rahmat / Tera waada"]]}},{"id":"sec_s4l6_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 6</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer-e-Muttasil Mukhaatab: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ (Page 16)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer (ـكَ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتُكَ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• بَيْتٌ (Ghar) se بَيْتُكَ (Tera ghar) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 16):** Kisi bhi ism ke aakhir mein **`ـكَ`** (Kaf par Zabar) lagane se **'Tera / Teri / Aapka'** ka mafhoom paida hota hai: `بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُكَ` (tera ghar), `رَبٌّ ← رَبُّكَ` (aapka Rabb), `وَرَبُّكَ الْغَفُورُ ذُو الرَّحْمَةِ` (aur aapka Rabb bakhshne wala rahmat wala hai)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l6_g2","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_number